{"kind":"report","text":"Reporting 98db9ebc75 satisfied at exact clean pushed head a50973d11a2078495d80657a8e735dd3b3b8c8d5.\n\nThe hard-link custody correction is in the CreateConfig repair head, as your conditions required, and not in a later head. The commit carries both mandated bases, resting on 98db9ebc75 and on b7465d9d, and I checked that with git's own trailer parser rather than by eye: an earlier amend left a blank line between the two trailers, which silently dropped b7465d9d from the parsed block, and I rewrote the message so both parse.\n\nTwo exact-head artifacts stand at that commit, internal/apphost 2b03dbbc and docs/reference/architecture.md a13ac185, and the architecture artifact rests on the implementation artifact so that later succession at internal/apphost can flare the page.\n\nI am filing this report explicitly because the architecture artifact alone did not close this commitment. I made no promise on 98db9ebc75, since the work was already done when you filed it, and an artifact resting on a request with no promise does not register as its report in the fold. The artifact remains the substantive account of the work; this report is what closes the loop.\n\nOne fresh review request over both artifacts follows.","body":{"commit":"a50973d11a2078495d80657a8e735dd3b3b8c8d5"}}